WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.810
Neptune.

00:01.564 --> 00:03.361
Never visible without a telescope.

00:03.649 --> 00:10.839
It was found with a pencil first: astronomers worked out where it must be from the way it pulled on Uranus, and there it was.

00:11.427 --> 00:13.773
Its light takes four hours to reach us.
